  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "Python入門",
    "sub_ename": "GETTING STARTED WITH PYTHON",
    "describe_ch": "Python是一種物件導向、直譯式的跨平台電腦程式語言，它包含了一組功能完備的標準庫和豐富套件生態系，可以輕鬆完成很多常見的任務（例如：讀寫檔案、自然語言處理、 網站開發、機器學習等），它的語法簡單，許多開發者推薦 Python 為初學者第一個學習的程式語言。課程內容包括程式邏輯概念、程式語法、及應用介紹。",
    "describe_eh": "Python is an object-oriented program language. It is composed of a full standard program library. It could be easily used to complete ordinary jobs. i.g. data input-output, friendly language processing、network development、machine-learning etc. Its program language is simple, therefore Python is suggested for the first program language for beginners. The content of the course includes Logical introduction, programming language, and its applications.",
    "pre_subname": "COND1003計算機概論",
    "pre_sub_id3": "COND1003",
    "pre_sub_ename": "COND1003 INTRODUCTION TO  COMPUTER AND COMPUTING",
